{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02696",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 4.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.25,
      "end_seconds": 10.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.13,
      "end_seconds": 19.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "It's periods becoming irregular. I thought I'd wait, you know, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.85,
      "end_seconds": 23.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.48,
      "end_seconds": 38.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.91,
      "end_seconds": 66.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 112 over 70, heart rate 71, SpO2 99 percent on room air. And respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.8,
      "end_seconds": 74.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Mm, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.27,
      "end_seconds": 80.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly. When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.47,
      "end_seconds": 93.61,
      "duration_seconds": 11.14,
      "text": "Actually, hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.08,
      "end_seconds": 98.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.29,
      "end_seconds": 105.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Maybe a seven out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.43,
      "end_seconds": 108.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.38,
      "end_seconds": 117.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "Hot flushes goes along with it, most of the time. I've also had poor sleep."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.63,
      "end_seconds": 119.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.31,
      "end_seconds": 130.43,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "The hot flushes? That's been for two months. As for hot flushes, it settles a little with a fan."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.97,
      "end_seconds": 136.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Have you noticed bleeding after sex or very heavy bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.86,
      "end_seconds": 143.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Actually, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.13,
      "end_seconds": 149.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Any weight loss or pelvic pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.47,
      "end_seconds": 155.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss or pelvic pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.45,
      "end_seconds": 160.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.36,
      "end_seconds": 164.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Let me think, I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.41,
      "end_seconds": 169.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.81,
      "end_seconds": 173.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.99,
      "end_seconds": 176.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.13,
      "end_seconds": 185.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Mm, I take lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.1,
      "end_seconds": 197.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Okay, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.61,
      "end_seconds": 201.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Yes, amoxicillin. I get hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.83,
      "end_seconds": 217.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Alright, does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.21,
      "end_seconds": 222.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Uh, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.71,
      "end_seconds": 227.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.68,
      "end_seconds": 235.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "So, yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.86,
      "end_seconds": 240.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Okay, what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.65,
      "end_seconds": 245.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.55,
      "end_seconds": 248.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.82,
      "end_seconds": 257.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.2,
      "end_seconds": 263.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.23,
      "end_seconds": 269.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.6,
      "end_seconds": 273.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.16,
      "end_seconds": 279.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "I have acid reflux, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.58,
      "end_seconds": 287.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "I follow. Right, so acid reflux is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.85,
      "end_seconds": 292.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.29,
      "end_seconds": 295.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Alright, breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.86,
      "end_seconds": 317.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and the abdomen is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.61,
      "end_seconds": 319.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.65,
      "end_seconds": 328.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.63,
      "end_seconds": 344.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it points towards perimenopause."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.9,
      "end_seconds": 346.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.55,
      "end_seconds": 360.36,
      "duration_seconds": 12.81,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like perimenopause, but I'd like to confirm. We should do a blood count for irregular periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 361.23,
      "end_seconds": 363.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "The earliest is Monday, 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.9,
      "end_seconds": 366.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.43,
      "end_seconds": 389.31,
      "duration_seconds": 21.88,
      "text": "Let's get a thyroid test, for hot flushes. I'm prescribing estradiol gel, 1 pump, once a day, long term. It's for menopausal symptoms. Regular exercise, light layers and avoiding triggers can help. Let's plan a check in three months. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.76,
      "end_seconds": 394.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}